## Browse the component gallery

Use Left and Right while the category tabs are focused, or select a tab
with the mouse. Press Tab and Shift+Tab to move through each interactive
preview. Long sections can be scrolled with the arrow, Page Up, and Page
Down keys or the mouse wheel.

The gallery covers every built-in component in `Breeze.Blocks`, including
controlled form inputs, collections, Markdown, flash messages, and a modal.
